a, el pelo atado mientras cocinas. Y el pelo se lava de noche y se seca bien antes de acostarte. Nunca mojado a la almohada. El champú en seco no lava. Tapa. Regla número 10. Lo que comes. Una vez llevé al hotel una comida casera con mucho ajo, la receta de mi madre. Satosán no dijo nada. Abrió la ventana del vestuario y la dejó abierta toda la tarde. El ajo y la cebolla no se quedan en la boca. Pasan a la sangre y salen por el aliento y por la piel hasta dos días después. Lo que comiste el domingo sigue en tu piel el martes. Y el cepillo de dientes no llega ahí.", "words": [{"w": " y", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.22}, {"w": " en", "s": 0.22, "e": 0.34}, {"w": " nuestras", "s": 0.34, "e": 0.7}, {"w": " casas,", "s": 0.7, "e": 1.38}, {"w": " cocinamos", "s": 1.44, "e": 2.08}, {"w": " con", "s": 2.08, "e": 2.3}, {"w": " la", "s": 2.3, "e": 2.5}, {"w": " puerta", "s": 2.5, "e": 2.74}, {"w": " cerrada,", "s": 2.74, "e": 3.3}, {"w": " sin", "s": 3.54, "e": 3.7}, {"w": " el", "s": 3.7, "e": 4.02}, {"w": " extractor,", "s": 4.02, "e": 4.56}, {"w": " con", "s": 4.82, "e": 4.96}, {"w": " la", "s": 4.96, "e": 5.16}, {"w": " sartén", "s": 5.16, "e": 5.7}, {"w": " llena", "s": 5.7, "e": 6.02}, {"w": " de", "s": 6.02, "e": 6.28}, {"w": " aceite.", "s": 6.28, "e": 6.58}, {"w": " Y", "s": 6.98, "e": 7.32}, {"w": " después,", "s": 7.32, "e": 7.7}, {"w": " salimos.", "s": 8.0, "e": 8.44}, {"w": " Cuando", "s": 8.68, "e": 9.0}, {"w": " alguien", "s": 9.0, "e": 9.28}, {"w": " te", "s": 9.28, "e": 9.54}, {"w": " abraza,", "s": 9.54, "e": 9.98}, {"w": " su", "s": 10.22, "e": 10.38}, {"w": " cara", "s": 10.38, "e": 10.64}, {"w": " pasa", "s": 10.64, "e": 10.96}, {"w": " por", "s": 10.96, "e": 11.24}, {"w": " tu", "s": 11.24, "e": 11.42}, {"w": " hombro", "s": 11.42, "e": 11.8}, {"w": " y", "s": 11.8, "e": 12.06}, {"w": " se", "s": 12.06, "e": 12.32}, {"w": " queda", "s": 12.32, "e": 12.44}, {"w": " en", "s": 12.44, "e": 12.64}, {"w": " tu", "s": 12.64, "e": 12.78}, {"w": " pelo.", "s": 12.78, "e": 